#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "triton-to-annotation"
msgstr "triton-to-annotation"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"处理Ascend NPU特有的编译提示指令 "
"(`extension.compile_hint`)，将其转换为后端的Annotation方言，用于指导后续的硬件特定优化或资源配置。"
msgstr ""
"Handle Ascend NPU-specific compilation hint directives (`tl.compile_hint`), "
"converting them into the backend's Annotation dialect to guide subsequent "
"hardware-specific optimizations or resource allocation."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "TritonAnnotationConversion"
msgstr "TritonAnnotationConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"将 `triton::AnnotationOp` 转换为 `annotation::MarkOp`，实现高级编译提示信息向底层注释标记的传递。"
msgstr ""
"Translate `triton::AnnotationOp` to `annotation::MarkOp`, enabling the "
"propagation of high-level compilation hints to low-level annotation markers."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "triton-to-hfusion"
msgstr "triton-to-hfusion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "将Triton中的`TTIR`转换为Ascend NPU硬件加速器`HFusion`方言中的对应操作。"
msgstr ""
"Convert `TTIR` in Triton to the corresponding operation in the `HFusion` "
"dialect of the Ascend NPU hardware accelerator."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"
msgstr "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "将 `triton::HistogramOp` 转换为 `hfusion::HistogramOp`，使其能在NPU的专用硬件上高效执行。"
msgstr ""
"Convert `triton::HistogramOp` to `hfusion::HistogramOp` so that it can "
"execute efficiently on the dedicated hardware of the NPU."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "triton-to-hivm"
msgstr "triton-to-hivm"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"处理Triton的块同步操作 (`extension.sync_block_all`, `extension.sync_block_set`, "
"`extension.sync_block_wait`)，将其转换为Ascend "
"NPU的`HIVM`方言中的跨核心同步指令。这些指令用于管理多核流水线中的同步与数据依赖，是流水优化的关键。"
msgstr ""
"Handle Triton's block synchronization operations (`tl.sync_block_all`, "
"`tl.sync_block_set`, `tl.sync_block_wait`), converting them into cross-core "
"synchronization instructions in Ascend NPU's `HIVM` dialect. These "
"instructions are used to manage synchronization and data dependencies in "
"multi-core pipelines, and are key to pipeline optimization."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"
msgstr "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"实现Triton同步指令到HIVM同步指令的转换：`sync_block_all`（全局块同步）；`sync_block_set`（设置同步点）；`sync_block_wait`（等待同步点）"
msgstr ""
"Implementing the conversion of Triton synchronization instructions to HIVM "
"synchronization instructions:<br>• `sync_block_all`: Global block "
"synchronization<br>• `sync_block_set`: Set synchronization point<br>• "
"`sync_block_wait`: Wait for synchronization point"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "triton-to-llvm"
msgstr "triton-to-llvm"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"将Triton中的内联汇编操作 (`extension.inline_assembly`) 转换为LLVM方言的内联汇编，并最终映射为Ascend "
"NPU的CCE硬件固有函数（Intrinsics）"
msgstr ""
"Translate Triton's inline assembly operations (`tl.inline_assembly`) into "
"LLVM dialect inline assembly, and ultimately map them to Ascend NPU's CCE "
"hardware intrinsics."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"
msgstr "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "将 `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` 转换为 `LLVM::InlineAsmOp` 。"
msgstr "Converts `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` to `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:220
msgid "3.2.3 SIMT 编译器（Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品）"
msgstr "3.2.3 SIMT Compiler (Ascend 950PR&950DT Series Products)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:222
msgid ""
"Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 在 SIMD 路径之外增加 SIMT 能力，用于加速**非结构化 / 离散**访存（如间接索引的 "
"load/store）。 开发者通过 `compile_mode` 选择编译路径。"
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950PR&950DT series products add SIMT capability beyond the SIMD path "
"to accelerate **unstructured/discrete** memory access (such as indirect "
"indexed load/store). Developers select the compilation path via "
"`compile_mode`."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:225
msgid "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` 说明"
msgstr "3.2.3.1 Explanation of `compile_mode`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "`compile_mode`"
msgstr "`compile_mode`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "编译路径"
msgstr "Compilation path"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "`\"simd\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd\"`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "纯 SIMD：结构化访存走 DMA；非结构化走标量循环"
msgstr ""
"Pure SIMD: structured memory access uses DMA; unstructured access uses "
"scalar loops."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`（**默认**）"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"` (**default**)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "混合：结构化仍走 SIMD；离散访存尽量走 SIMT 模板"
msgstr ""
"Hybrid: structured access still uses SIMD; discrete memory access tries to "
"use SIMT templates as much as possible."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"simt_only\"`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "纯 SIMT：直接下发 Triton IR 给NPU IR处理"
msgstr "Pure SIMT: Directly dispatch Triton IR to NPU IR processing."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:233
msgid "用法示例："
msgstr "Usage example:"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:235
msgid ""
"# 纯 SIMD\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd\")\n"
"\n"
"# 混合（默认；Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 上离散访存优先走 SIMT）\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\")\n"
"\n"
"# 纯 SIMT\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simt_only\", num_warps=32)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Pure SIMD\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd\")\n"
"\n"
"# Hybrid (default; on Ascend 950PR & 950DT products, discrete memory access prioritizes SIMT)\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\")\n"
"\n"
"# Pure SIMT\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simt_only\", num_warps=32)\n"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:246
msgid "3.2.3.2 三种模式的编译分流"
msgstr "3.2.3.2 Compilation and Distribution for the Three Modes"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "阶段"
msgstr "Stage"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`"
msgstr "\"simd_simt_template\""

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "离散 mask 处理"
msgstr "Discrete mask processing"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "拆成连续/离散边界，用 load + select / store 处理"
msgstr ""
"Split into continuous/discrete boundaries, handle with load + select / "
"store."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 且张量维数 ≤ 5：标记后交给下游；否则同左"
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950PR&950DT series products and tensor dimension ≤ 5: mark it and "
"pass it downstream; otherwise, same as left."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "不运行"
msgstr "Not running"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "非结构化访存"
msgstr "Unstructured memory access"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "展开为标量循环"
msgstr "Expand into scalar loop."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "尽量转为 SIMT 间接访存（维数 ≤ 5）；失败则回退标量循环"
msgstr ""
"Try to convert to SIMT indirect memory access (dimensions ≤ 5); if "
"unsuccessful, fall back to scalar loops."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "TritonToLinalg"
msgstr "TritonToLinalg"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级"
msgstr "Standard Linalg IR lowering"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:295
msgid "3.2.3.3 混合模式：只对离散访存走 SIMT"
msgstr "3.2.3.3 Hybrid Mode: Only Discrete Memory Accesses Use SIMT"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:297
msgid "混合模式**不会**把整个 kernel 切到 SIMT，只对离散 / 非结构化访存点走 SIMT，其余仍走 SIMD："
msgstr ""
"Hybrid mode does **not** switch the entire kernel to SIMT; it only uses SIMT"
" for discrete/unstructured memory access points, while the rest continues to"
" use SIMD."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:299
msgid "**离散 mask 处理**"
msgstr "**Discrete mask processing**"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:300
msgid ""
"若判定为非连续 mask，且满足 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品、混合模式、维数 ≤ 5：不改写 IR，只标记「下游走 SIMT」。"
msgstr ""
"If it is determined to be a non-contiguous mask, and it satisfies Ascend "
"950PR&950DT series products, mixed mode, and dimension ≤ 5: do not rewrite "
"the IR, only mark \"downstream goes SIMT\"."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:301
msgid "否则（纯 SIMD 或不满足条件）：将 mask 拆成连续 / 离散部分，用连续边界限定全局内存访问，再通过 select 合并结果。"
msgstr ""
"Otherwise (pure SIMD or conditions not met): split the mask into "
"contiguous/discrete parts, use contiguous boundaries to limit global memory "
"access, and then merge the results via select."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:303
msgid "**非结构化访存处理**"
msgstr "**Handling of Unstructured Memory Access**"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:304
msgid "在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 混合模式下，对非结构化访存或已标记的离散访存走 SIMT 快速通道："
msgstr ""
"In Ascend 950PR&950DT series products hybrid mode, unstructured memory "
"access or marked discrete memory access goes through the SIMT fast path:"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:305
msgid "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`（维数 ≤ 5）"
msgstr "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store` (dimension ≤ 5)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:306
msgid "`atomic` 操作 → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"
msgstr "`atomic` operation → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:307
msgid "不满足条件则回退为标量循环（与 `\"simd\"` 一致）。"
msgstr ""
"If the condition is not met, it falls back to scalar loop (consistent with "
"`\"simd\"`)."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:309
msgid "**TritonToLinalg**"
msgstr "**TritonToLinalg**"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:310
msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级。"
msgstr "Regular Linalg IR lowering."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:312
msgid "3.2.3.4 纯 SIMT（`simt_only`）"
msgstr "3.2.3.4 Pure SIMT (`simt_only`)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:314
msgid "`simt_only` 直接下发 Triton IR 交给 AscendNPU IR 做纯 SIMT 编译。"
msgstr ""
"`simt_only` directly dispatches Triton IR to AscendNPU IR for pure SIMT "
"compilation."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:316
msgid "3.2.4 Ascend 亲和算子"
msgstr "3.2.4 Ascend Affinitive Operators"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:318
msgid ""
"为表达标准 Triton 无法覆盖的 Ascend 硬件语义（Cube-Vector 跨核协作、UB 数据搬运、硬件特定访存等），后端在 "
"`triton.language` 上扩展了一组 Ascend 亲和算子。按能力分为三类："
msgstr ""
"To express Ascend hardware semantics that standard Triton cannot cover "
"(Cube-Vector cross-core collaboration, UB data movement, hardware-specific "
"memory access, etc.), the backend extends a set of Ascend affinitive "
"operators on top of `triton.language`. They are categorized into three types"
" by capability:"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "代表扩展"
msgstr "Representative Extension"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "架构作用"
msgstr "Architectural Role"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "硬件特定数据搬运"
msgstr "Hardware-Specific Data Movement"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid ""
"`extension.custom_op`（`index_select` / `index_put`、`gather_out_to_ub` / "
"`scatter_ub_to_out`、`indirect_load` / `indirect_store` 等）"
msgstr ""
"`extension.custom_op` (`index_select` / `index_put`, `gather_out_to_ub` / "
"`scatter_ub_to_out`, `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`, etc.)"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid ""
"支持基于索引的 gather/scatter、GM ↔ Unified Buffer 直传、间接地址访存等硬件特定搬运模式，供 SIMD/SIMT "
"各编译路径复用。"
msgstr ""
"Supports hardware-specific data movement patterns such as index-based "
"gather/scatter, GM ↔ Unified Buffer direct transfer, and indirect address "
"memory access, for reuse across SIMD/SIMT compilation paths."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "编译提示"
msgstr "Compilation Hint"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "`extension.compile_hint`"
msgstr "tl.compile_hint"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定提示，指导后端优化策略、资源分配与内核配置。"
msgstr ""
"Pass hardware-specific compilation hints to the compiler to guide backend "
"optimization strategies, resource allocation, or kernel configuration."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "跨核块同步"
msgstr "Cross-Core Block Synchronization"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid ""
"`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / "
"`extension.sync_block_all`"
msgstr ""
"`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / "
"`extension.sync_block_all`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:248
msgid "显式协调 Cube-Vector 架构下的核间执行顺序与数据依赖：点对点等待 / 通知，以及按模式广播的全局块同步。"
msgstr ""
"Explicitly coordinates inter-core execution order and data dependencies "
"under the Cube-Vector architecture: point-to-point wait / notify, and global"
" block synchronization by mode broadcast."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:326
msgid ""
"各扩展的函数签名、参数取值、使用限制与示例以 Python API 参考为准（避免与架构文档两处维护）：见 "
"[triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-"
"ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-"
"api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html)——索引/gather/scatter 等搬运类见 "
"*Vector/Memory Extension Ops*、自定义算子机制见 *Custom Ops*、跨核同步见 "
"*Synchronization*、编译提示与多缓冲见 *Core Types*。"
msgstr ""
"For the function signatures, parameter values, usage restrictions, and "
"examples of each extension, refer to the Python API reference (to avoid "
"maintaining them in both the architecture document and the API reference): "
"see [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-"
"ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-"
"api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html) — for index/gather/scatter "
"and other data movement operations, see *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*; for "
"the custom operator mechanism, see *Custom Ops*; for cross-core "
"synchronization, see *Synchronization*; for compilation hints and multi-"
"buffer, see *Core Types*."

msgid ""
"# Pure SIMD\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd\")\n"
"\n"
"# Hybrid (default; on Ascend 950PR & 950DT products, discrete memory access prioritizes SIMT)\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\")\n"
"\n"
"# Pure SIMT\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simt_only\", num_warps=32)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Pure SIMD\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd\")\n"
"\n"
"# Hybrid (default; on Ascend 950PR & 950DT products, discrete memory access prioritizes SIMT)\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\")\n"
"\n"
"# Pure SIMT\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simt_only\", num_warps=32)\n"

msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[compile_mode] --> B[\"simd\"]\n"
"    A --> C[\"simd_simt_template\"]\n"
"    A --> D[\"simt_only\"]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simt_only 分支\n"
"    D --> D1[直接下发 Triton IR，纯SIMT编译，Triton IR → AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd 完整链路\n"
"    B --> B1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    B1 --> B2[拆成连续/离散后用 SIMD 方式处理]\n"
"    B2 --> B3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    B3 --> B4[离散访存展开为标量循环]\n"
"    B4 --> B5[TritonToLinalg]\n"
"    B5 --> B6[AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd_simt_template 完整链路\n"
"    C --> C1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    C1 --> C2[满足条件打上标记，下发下层SIMT处理]\n"
"    C2 --> C3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    C3 --> C4{离散访存可转为 indirect_load/store SIMT 模板？}\n"
"    C4 -- 是 --> B5\n"
"    C4 -- 否 --> C5[回退标量循环]\n"
"    C5 --> B5\n"
"\n"
"    %% 样式定义（低饱和度钢蓝 / 青灰 / 中性灰，稳重严肃）\n"
"    classDef root fill:#d6dee8,stroke:#2c4257,stroke-width:2px,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef mode fill:#e4eaf1,stroke:#3c5872,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef pass fill:#eef2f6,stroke:#4d6580,color:#23303d\n"
"    classDef logic fill:#f0f3f2,stroke:#5f7a72,color:#26322d\n"
"    classDef simtOnly fill:#f1f1f1,stroke:#707070,color:#2b2b2b\n"
"\n"
"    %% 绑定样式\n"
"    class A root\n"
"    class B,C mode\n"
"    class B1,C1,B3,C3,B5,B6 pass\n"
"    class B2,B4,C2,C4,C5 logic\n"
"    class D,D1 simtOnly"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[compile_mode] --> B[\"simd\"]\n"
"    A --> C[\"simd_simt_template\"]\n"
"    A --> D[\"simt_only\"]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simt_only \n"
"    D --> D1[ Triton IR，SIMT，Triton IR → AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd \n"
"    B --> B1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    B1 --> B2[/ SIMD ]\n"
"    B2 --> B3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    B3 --> B4[]\n"
"    B4 --> B5[TritonToLinalg]\n"
"    B5 --> B6[AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd_simt_template \n"
"    C --> C1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    C1 --> C2[，SIMT]\n"
"    C2 --> C3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    C3 --> C4{ indirect_load/store SIMT template？}\n"
"    C4 --  --> B5\n"
"    C4 --  --> C5[]\n"
"    C5 --> B5\n"
"\n"
"    %% （ /  / ，）\n"
"    classDef root fill:#d6dee8,stroke:#2c4257,stroke-width:2px,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef mode fill:#e4eaf1,stroke:#3c5872,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef pass fill:#eef2f6,stroke:#4d6580,color:#23303d\n"
"    classDef logic fill:#f0f3f2,stroke:#5f7a72,color:#26322d\n"
"    classDef simtOnly fill:#f1f1f1,stroke:#707070,color:#2b2b2b\n"
"\n"
"    %% \n"
"    class A root\n"
"    class B,C mode\n"
"    class B1,C1,B3,C3,B5,B6 pass\n"
"    class B2,B4,C2,C4,C5 logic\n"
"    class D,D1 simtOnly"
